        "Content": "KITCHEN\nHandcrafted solid wood fitted kitchen with granite worktops\n\nFeature solid fuel stove with back boiler\n\nExposed timber beams and vaulted pine ceiling\n\nWooden flooring\n\nIntegrated double oven and ample fitted storage\n\nKitchen island providing additional workspace and casual dining\n\nDual-aspect windows overlooking the mature gardens\n\nFeature block wall adding character and warmth\n\nDOWNSTAIRS WC\nvanity storage \n\nPainted tongue-and-groove wall panelling \n\nWood flooring\nTiled splashback\nmodern chrome fittings\n\nDINING AREA\nFeature natural stone fireplace and solid fuel stove\n\nPine tongue-and-groove walls and ceiling\nTiled flooring\n\nTimber staircase leading to the first floor.\n\nFeature exposed timber lintel and original stonework\n\nSITTING ROOM\nFeature natural stone fireplace with solid fuel stove\nSolid pine flooring throughout.\n\nPine tongue-and-groove walls with decorative beamed ceiling.\n\n\nBuilt-in window seat creating a cosy reading nook\n\nRecessed lighting\n\nSUN ROOM\nBright triple-aspect sunroom with floor-to-ceiling glazing \nTiled flooring for durability and easy maintenance\n\nLarge roof skylights\nExposed timber beams and vaulted ceiling \n\n\nBEDROOM 1 (GROUND FLOOR)\nDouble bedroom with built-in timber wardrobes.\n\nWood-effect laminate flooring\nTongue-and-groove timber ceiling\n\nBEDROOM 2\nVaulted tongue-and-groove timber ceiling and walls.\n\nWood-effect laminate flooring throughout.\n\nTwo Velux roof windows\n\nBuilt-in wardrobe with additional eaves storage\n\nBEDROOM 3\nDual-aspect windows \n\nWood-effect laminate flooring throughout\nWarm tongue-and-groove timber walls and ceiling\nBuilt-in wardrobes\n\nBEDROOM 4\n\nWood-effect laminate flooring throughout.\nTimber ceiling with pine half-panelled walls.\n\n\nSTORAGE ROOM\nWood-effect laminate flooring\n\nVelux roof window\nBuilt-in shelving\n\n\nOFFICE SPACE\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
